{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线首先落在左上方第一块大字号金白文字，尤其是金色的“憋着一股气”；随后容易被中部第二块同样醒目的大字号灰白标题吸引。右上角目录和下半部分动画不是主要视觉入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个仍憋着气、已经离开从前那种生活的人，想起曾经被当作自己人。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、不甘；短暂高兴，随后发酸、失落。\",\n  \"missed\": \"离开以后是否真的会更好过的疑问，以及过去无法重来的失落究竟如何影响当下，需要进一步读第二块标题才能完整理解。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块字号都很大、视觉权重接近的文字争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块大标题里：第一块交代憋气、被接纳和短暂高兴，第二块才交代高兴转为心酸及离开后的疑问，需要拼接才能理解完整处境和情绪关系。\",\n    \"单块标题本身较长，包含不止一层意思。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1e048b60-18e7-428e-ad10-c0e725daa809", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T013056451172Z", "elapsed_seconds": 30.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:31:27.114364+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "08995b12fb6775212967418048f64799d05fe709426716ca27f71d9cf42aa380", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a